      "url": "https://sim.atlassian.net/wiki/pages/20000",
      "body": "h1. payments-api runbook\n\nOwned by team payments (alice, bob). Alerts go to #payments-alerts; incidents are discussed in #incidents.\n\nh2. Known failure modes\n\nh3. PaymentGatewayTimeout\nSymptom: log lines containing 'PaymentGatewayTimeout: gateway did not respond within 30s' from charge().\nCheck: error rate panel for service=payments-api; search logs for the trace_id in the alert.\nRemediation: roll back the latest deploy of payments-api; if persists, page payments on-call.\n\nh3. LedgerMismatch\nSymptom: log lines containing 'LedgerMismatch: ledger balance mismatch for account' from reconcile().\nCheck: error rate panel for service=payments-api; search logs for the trace_id in the alert.\nRemediation: roll back the latest deploy of payments-api; if persists, page payments on-call.\n\nh2. Dashboards\nChronosphere: rate(http_requests_total{service=\"payments-api\",code=~\"5..\"}[5m])\n"
     },
     "error": null,
     "duration_ms": 4.0,
     "attempts": [],
     "extracts": {
